WEBVTT

00:04:29.974 --> 00:04:31.559
Am I making this up?

00:04:32.059 --> 00:04:33.728
Is my pain even real?"

00:04:34.812 --> 00:04:38.357
In an online survey of 2,400
American women

00:04:38.357 --> 00:04:41.027
with a variety of chronic pain conditions,

00:04:41.027 --> 00:04:44.363
91 percent felt
that the health care system

00:04:44.405 --> 00:04:46.157
discriminated against them.

00:04:46.198 --> 00:04:50.119
And nearly half were told
that the pain was all in their heads.

00:04:51.537 --> 00:04:54.206
So let's go ahead and dispel
that pain myth right away.

00:04:54.540 --> 00:04:58.336
If you're worried that your pain
is in your head,

00:04:58.336 --> 00:04:59.503
you're right.

00:04:59.879 --> 00:05:02.423
Because pain is in everyone's heads.